    {
      "id": "462208e8-18f0-42f4-ae0f-815ce5e8d7fc",
      "title": "Leia a explicação curta e observe o foco da pergunta.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 4,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "13756720-2fbd-4a6f-bc49-93d09a86f062",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>¿Dónde está...?</strong> serve para perguntar a localização de um lugar específico.</p><p>Depois da pergunta, entra o lugar que você procura. Nesta aula, a primeira referência é <strong>la farmacia</strong>.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "180c1ab7-0e43-45cc-be09-5c5474b287fe",
      "title": "Escute e leia a frase em espanhol.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 5,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "fcea6b46-aa94-4a4e-812a-0fb124d4e9be",
          "textContent": "<p>Escute uma resposta curta.</p><p><strong>La farmacia está cerca de la plaza.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>A farmácia fica perto da praça.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/b3fbb1f9050b45b1947ab40b9841a4e9_barrio-lugares.png?Expires=1794099485&Signature=BhXnT~Vtj4UoLQcsuB7uPKY9HxdX-vEqw8XVDKSA0XQlVaHeWI-qXG2q8TF9GSW3pfHUl-sUz-ayGax-8wI0q7j7zIgCYDqqXpobqcOvNHMj08SfZF8rT99hg-N6iKxIg~POb~bv1tLqWgPMp4wkL9m3FbcTKYsbLmdh6uEeZqFxAAPnGAk4dlazIL2oOFvY2NQgSwRQzf2cJuJfHDoAcrem1xZRwFqZieGsawscSYwbwRwyrarzNsJD3CKfGpGOqZwd0iH0W8iZrOJb8dEGaV-dKnekHwNoWHpJTzica2u2qN6BpV6EynFeNtyiy3btTh7WNbeBRDK6h020zRAF6g__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/1f9f5dc5a1c547b0bf507c8bbd447f8b_la-farmacia-esta-cerca-de-la-plaza.mp3?Expires=1794099485&Signature=agV2tEX-syzfYt0Mnjs8galoAE5WOsLDXmDLQqvdoqr5kmYHk6BetD6QdZas-coiFYRwjlcS6DNqHeOAbj7htvAn2B5g4o7x-lUsmGyBUENVulfUoe7LNNxHWAmNLkbg5hI-nAB71thiCqHN-T6cfRxLxovdYGf6sAJdS-jD1JSiJDenFyNyZkiNNxqe1XD7c1aAA0ul1j2UyON0lhf8z5Pi06T5RnBv3TEA4oliriggveg-AYpBzWCyYz3rkUAlGWJCwcRDqp9GJX8vtZtUjKsQZo12ZV1BW~wYB~855EXr4CqWETRKc0kW2~vy8tijZawp3sfaUbS6KNvT0A7frw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
